#: scenario5:scenario5_5351814B_5466_4814_92DD_53303F78A75E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3941c2ed3642381d181dd3af34ee7768e17a152a3d684a4fe2b31edd121c502c
#. default-sha256: bb45ca3a8c471a0fe1305a43c26cdba13806653c9c0bbbd64ea8861628bd2550
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5351814B_5466_4814_92DD_53303F78A75E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Before long, winter retreated and our second spring came "
"to take its place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫그리고 ⟪k:9⟫겨울이 지나―― 두 번째 봄이 왔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_435A89A1_6490_46EC_B689_8B258E374994
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03dca7d30e7f8d8c9df9eb3db6fe226b2d8f89eb550d64e45bcd53ab2084f4af
#. default-sha256: 43639134dc605e9fe1bf41e211c11a5527a197c1c45525e6f1b83172e76f9d8d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_435A89A1_6490_46EC_B689_8B258E374994"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A full year had passed since we had resumed living together,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤과 내가 ⟪k:1⟫다시 함께 살기 시작한 지 ⟪k:2⟫1년이 지났다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4A897F4C_E0E2_415A_A9A0_1CCB1D2596EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c47d5c96b0db46ac26861de659631e3c4d2f28d6ec528d7be6040ef2a1beab1
#. default-sha256: e7d7d5d2dfa27a52d3bba97ec96acc844fd2ab1d333d9be3be8b0228e3c78372
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4A897F4C_E0E2_415A_A9A0_1CCB1D2596EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and I don’t think it was my imagination that this year felt much warmer than last."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫1년 전에 비해 ⟪k:1⟫기온이 많이 따뜻해진 느낌이 드는 건 ⟪k:2⟫착각이 아니었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_428E1259_31F0_4BC3_A73C_8A6F40A6E566
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c10a55baca66873ec486398fa78a1c3dd173c9af3f4fe88d6bf53348ce6c49c
#. default-sha256: 738997b2b101afe8ba1c867a66e50b7997478cdc48c7493790e8294e720c8525
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_428E1259_31F0_4BC3_A73C_8A6F40A6E566"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One night, when the breeze carried on it a pleasant residual warmth,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫예년보다 봄이 일찍 찾아온 것이리라.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫화창한 온기의 예감을 실은 ⟪k:3⟫포근한 바람이 부"
"는 밤에――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B6FBF873_546C_419B_B190_E0FE79CA05FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08ab2695de39be644f19d0e9e80655c2e61f312d39d334830c18295467243134
#. default-sha256: b4ced71936cde0d0cfbdb3a73a57bb3e933bba3144a3c3487ae5eb917ab5e685
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B6FBF873_546C_419B_B190_E0FE79CA05FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Giselle escorted me out to the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤은 ⟪k:1⟫나를 정원으로 데리고 왔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_45A3DCF0_F746_44F4_8DD0_2876BDAE6D14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e7cf9592a104994b522f0c1acde84cb5ddee62e6110690b18589296bf3bb207
#. default-sha256: 00d76842a0a929aeeac90426c5bde8cd684b17462b8bad0962fd936bf9796f2d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_45A3DCF0_F746_44F4_8DD0_2876BDAE6D14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come on, Master! Hurry up!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫주인님! ⟪k:3⟫빨리, ⟪k:4⟫빨리요!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_04A9B3BA_9BD2_4765_9F52_2D74F2237B51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c919b0746339fb9882f075071e83ba520cb3f764c156ca50e5ba86171bf5735
#. default-sha256: 5e9f1cd5ff2d684b4875c671b2a0888983bbeef25180e63b1b7260fe715e5845
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_04A9B3BA_9BD2_4765_9F52_2D74F2237B51"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It’s the middle of the night... ⟪k:1⟫What’s so important..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫대체 뭡니까, ⟪k:1⟫이런 밤중에……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD08FE95_5669_41DF_8099_3B0D7A8EA63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8a1863de356796031f007a920ea7d29017060c626601bbf61f6d2908340c7b6
#. default-sha256: 19534f29fd88edd570f6217eb55736b4f9a6ce3b686a49dcf8b91abb23df0976
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD08FE95_5669_41DF_8099_3B0D7A8EA63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just found it myself!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And I couldn’t wait until morning!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저도 ⟪k:1⟫방금 전에 알아챈 걸 어떡하겠어요!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫알고 나니 ⟪k:4⟫내일까지 못 참겠어서――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_73838757_5AED_47ED_8910_ADF274AB88A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ec72d8fe2d76807210e8dfb4e26f635eca994a778b127a2fded9a704ac9a18b
#. default-sha256: 9499e2d00af54d5ca6592d2cda584dd976f3e7ea6df6c9ed144d05377d1246c1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73838757_5AED_47ED_8910_ADF274AB88A3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A960CF7C_B617_45A5_A28C_256419E3CA3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcf74ea344f5c32321c2c717d234e0d70d261c2de9295c56065e29ce8e8f3bb7
#. default-sha256: f675f5276ae266adb6d3091de39963770d4c38d4c1e1a7a08bfd3a08fec7ba22
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A960CF7C_B617_45A5_A28C_256419E3CA3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A rose! It blossomed!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫장미꽃이 ⟪k:1⟫피어났거든요!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4173736F_04DD_49B2_9A5D_5C6EF1B71BB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4452e1ba806f766327631a2150cb876c3559b121c273fcf0af6c5e5e356ec6a9
#. default-sha256: 19953c9a3175bc2dc0d1fd7e1fa787c5f03318e4c6362fff2fb8b93e3b051f2f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4173736F_04DD_49B2_9A5D_5C6EF1B71BB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A rose...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫장미………?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8F06FDAA_D70F_4B25_9CB1_91BFBD550E52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bf89c1f0a1f4e62977c69233d1ec612c979960e9cff9c7c7b0b81e18c2356b4
#. default-sha256: 9de3ad39893279404f495776c316a9e5bc5851069568358fbe97d0b0cdae0d03
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8F06FDAA_D70F_4B25_9CB1_91BFBD550E52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle had, over the past year, cleaned up the nest of weeds that had been "
"strangling the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫잡초만 무성하던 정원도 ⟪k:3⟫지젤이 1년 동안 깔끔하게 정비했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_67607DCF_55B6_47B9_9971_EAEC3EBE36E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31e51ef40aa10e1c6e1accb729a5112c39f9e65ad012debeb22e3762b65cc91a
#. default-sha256: 88c3def918d2007092db9142121d8fa2b14595b6912d7f99b32a247fb1fedb46
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_67607DCF_55B6_47B9_9971_EAEC3EBE36E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Off to the side of a small plot of turned soil, swaying in the wind beneath the moonlight,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫작은 텃밭 구석에서 ⟪k:1⟫달빛을 쬐며 바람에 살랑이는 것은――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8B661D88_6305_4E48_8429_E8E84ACFF805
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f9a6a6a658506b32bb8a1aec416b7128a32003c8926973ca05bcb52b8b5eeb0
#. default-sha256: 269f4a6c1a6ec44c7638e80e1d34e01f58c3b36e8b18c722a4cfa39bcb1e1a4e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8B661D88_6305_4E48_8429_E8E84ACFF805"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was a single red rose."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫빨간 장미 ⟪k:1⟫한 송이였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E7A14ADD_A07F_4B64_84C0_417D505E204A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6aea657bc710564a0fc5a097915f0f0dcff1f8eefc9cfcae9f9fba14c0986e80
#. default-sha256: 57712d3a8860bb100205f319eccdfc04fde83baf31b83049ebe863d766251b38
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E7A14ADD_A07F_4B64_84C0_417D505E204A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When did you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어느새…… ⟪k:1⟫이런 걸 다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e4b0e5383500ebc42887eb0979bee4149f6ad4832923bf220222146a3eb2cd0
#. default-sha256: 57ac70129671348a91e4cb8569117c703fe4c86f4d2b784085c227e1f91b8cfa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Last year, I requested flower seeds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I just couldn’t get them to grow,⟪k:3⟫and "
"I was starting to think they never would..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫1년 전에 ⟪k:1⟫꽃 씨앗을 요청했거든요. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 피려는 기미가 안 보여서 ⟪k:3⟫역시 글렀나 싶"
"었는데――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3302F5D2_B114_4275_97BE_2F2149B8F654
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99507043900471dd2ed1194f6b2c74661ed0425224dacf817d36b8ad8a0d0a16
#. default-sha256: 93bf82e96ff012e1f8517be75c7d3fd89faa6d3e993cf1bfb0b139857edc91db
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3302F5D2_B114_4275_97BE_2F2149B8F654"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But look: it’s only one, but it did."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이것 좀 ⟪k:1⟫보세요. ⟪k:2⟫딱 한 송이긴 해도 ⟪k:3⟫피어났어요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3C367B04_7923_4F84_9389_FDCB52BD71D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c3c7a2e5b9fae71487cb507f54def5ad742334fa218f107251cf266612b8cff
#. default-sha256: a178bf0d0d8ff4d73b3052f7da5c0399e3b199f599fc175c6f3a273415818ae4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3C367B04_7923_4F84_9389_FDCB52BD71D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...I had no idea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………몰랐습니다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_34E128D5_962B_4B90_87DE_8DD815370172
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e6530e380eb87113997c3cbc24968a63e2b861c501046ee4d1d03cfe4901c0c
#. default-sha256: c402a94821ba170c104aa76a5ac66674821c9b1ff977ebce9ab46fc098c1a1a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_34E128D5_962B_4B90_87DE_8DD815370172"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course you didn’t. I didn’t tell you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇겠죠, ⟪k:1⟫말을 ⟪k:2⟫안 했으니까요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A64047C7_A745_40A3_AAF1_E6A770DCA609
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ff0772b59cfe1e07410c11cfb8bdaafc8651926eff74d2732cb7372eca8a12e
#. default-sha256: 03dc23d4e9f0dd914cb8b05ab5cdb1ee360694b42cf074303825bdec85f34e4e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A64047C7_A745_40A3_AAF1_E6A770DCA609"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why would you keep it from me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜 ⟪k:1⟫꽃을 심은 걸 비밀로 했습니까."

#: scenario5:scenario5_73C9FBF1_FFE7_4BE4_B0A0_3F9DA390FD4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3488910cafc193342484bdd209bbe81ed34e44d8a147144af644c8ae75641d3
#. default-sha256: ff718426a4bd5bac44ddef579aad2d930337457a97cb79b2e80f474a6eac1537
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73C9FBF1_FFE7_4BE4_B0A0_3F9DA390FD4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫to make it a gift for you, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이건―― ⟪k:1⟫제가 주인님한테 선물하려고 한 거거든요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DC4F977F_5278_4FD4_A6FE_FE627B9A881B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5877d652e7e64386bed36874ce8894d2abbbc6c4e08fa3b5d48ce72bb453c33e
#. default-sha256: 1599abd410b01eb3128a52d0fd2fa250a90cc47c05177016a8b5183f67eb6437
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DC4F977F_5278_4FD4_A6FE_FE627B9A881B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What...? ⟪k:1⟫Why?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……어. ⟪k:1⟫………어째섭니까."

#: scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7308938965aab2a585b5ae6295e1df36dcef234dbb5f3eb9ffbe674502fb58a
#. default-sha256: 730c0c7ec34f8382b130d9a59513b7ca4ec9b66f7f2133623e4b9aa7d5200255
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Roses make wonderful gifts, supposedly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫장미는―― 선물로 좋다고 해요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34eb1e3bca7105c0563e94e24922b998de8135c004cff0a81e59b8c79bc458a4
#. default-sha256: 36a44ec0a780170f3c04c689f955760b1504cba3f898f0c605d0a01f30e4fc5b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫that’s not what I meant. ⟪k:2⟫Why ⟪k:3⟫me⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I haven’t given you "
"anything..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아니……, ⟪k:1⟫그게 ⟪k:2⟫아니라―― 어째서 ⟪k:3⟫제게.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫저는 당신에게 아무것도 안 했는데"
"요……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3114e1df9074ab9586630a87cdd2c09abf54817eb0f43f02eeee036f2f42160
#. default-sha256: d970d1dae9f0c3ec3f4c36a90572fd5b5727b71e367a09b2eb7e77aa70a2cc39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consider it... ⟪k:1⟫a symbol of my hope that we’ll still be this close another year from "
"now. ⟪k:2⟫If we are, then this is yours."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫1년 후에도―― 친하게 지내고 있기를. ⟪k:1⟫그런 기원을 담은 거기도…… 해서 그렇겠네요. ⟪k:2⟫그게 "
"이뤄졌으니 ⟪k:3⟫이건 당신 거예요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bda85e4172e1ddd801277375922f9b35a462f5e4bd8c32d605dd89a73f4f321
#. default-sha256: 0e6714175292b87f6af2f7226581d96bcf68f6ff2ddd1d4a1e9fc85f8fd08498
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow her reasoning...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(무슨 논리인지 도통 모르겠어……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d240f767743f4c1b463b23d5614b829e2ba73c93131c6d22bca4d48c36c862e
#. default-sha256: 34e81978e6448546e41418cc03b9bfa991dcdaaecc9ec4642f60a60ce150472f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow it at all, but...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(모르⟪k:1⟫겠지만―――)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71679420ddb1f9aed329723c523b39a7e4b649e02a7913e7c6fb0de3173111a5
#. default-sha256: b643827ef8ff117c430f33e001aaf20d718e60e6d0d9d93a16da4ed1612cf389
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...The sight of the deep red rose almost melting into the dark night was perhaps the most "
"wondrous thing I had ever seen in my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫밤의 어둠 속에 어우러진 빨간 장미는 ⟪k:1⟫내가 여지껏 본 어떤 광경보다 ⟪k:2⟫환상적으로 보였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_12F92596_4849_4E96_BC08_4A9985D500EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4bd8457e11ac76d3205af4945858059772d87e2538b1a8e7407e2749087557f
#. default-sha256: 341f9a8d726dce69313f186f2eb2556812b82e34664ede5b46dce1408c77e43c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_12F92596_4849_4E96_BC08_4A9985D500EA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had never understood why some people found flowers so enchanting. They were always just "
"plants to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……꽃은 ⟪k:1⟫대수롭지도 않게 여겼다. ⟪k:2⟫꽃을 아끼는 여자의 마음이 ⟪k:3⟫살면서 이해가 된 적"
"이 없었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_386B0606_04E2_4C8B_907D_763CF8B59F2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2360d5cacc4e90b252a20df053800af2f77aa1d25f599e00852b5ea36bcd9a7
