#: scenario5:scenario5_8F6795EB_920D_4B7A_A94E_96A3D42F964E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4e79776998b5d046ed72c26561571e6570a6b9147f6b47f28b1b678c4490c1f
#. default-sha256: 17a5027bba8fa46d719b55d68feade7026e757b86eda7bb109d68b67d2c54328
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8F6795EB_920D_4B7A_A94E_96A3D42F964E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that one, on that night, was undeniably beautiful. Majestic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 순간, 나는 틀림없이 ⟪k:1⟫그 장미를 아름답고 ⟪k:2⟫특별한 것으로 여겼다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0067D284_793A_4A7E_832F_0099B385E0D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59ac5f6681e46d21a717f4793e3f2e668d55ef2a5adcaa21951146063f47db70
#. default-sha256: 48558030d950f5ad0d98fe9277f34512875f45dbfb770bb742ad02aa891e8f97
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0067D284_793A_4A7E_832F_0099B385E0D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And like a young child seeing a flower for the very first time,⟪k:1⟫my hand automatically "
"reached out for it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫마치 ⟪k:2⟫꽃이란 걸 처음 본 어린아이처럼. ⟪k:3⟫내 손은 ⟪k:4⟫자연스럽게 장미로 뻗"
"었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A9296EF_BD41_4D4B_9DC8_F731BB16D4BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f424a306bca79bd062589a3b1f6be8d5cc3565fde00716f4b2f65c7af527cebe
#. default-sha256: 28e5226ca48753c65adbcbc1e30c2195751c032323f4bff6cac208f0f475ac34
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A9296EF_BD41_4D4B_9DC8_F731BB16D4BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Not knowing the proper way to appreciate flowers,⟪k:2⟫I didn’t gently caress its petals "
"or take in its fragrance—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫꽃을 아끼거나 ⟪k:2⟫보듬는 법은 모른다. ⟪k:3⟫그래서 ⟪k:4⟫접하며 즐기는 ⟪k:5⟫서정적인 행위"
"가 아니라……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_147F4D85_B854_4C50_8DAA_0DD0E0C8AF60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11c42586edab0b29e1b54bcdbedd300d03b87a65d6a80c986205b63065140ae7
#. default-sha256: 7c70c4157b05667db6ee7f7c128be006bcbcb1daa75b9e8b8b30414bc2fec17f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_147F4D85_B854_4C50_8DAA_0DD0E0C8AF60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but snapped its stem."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫순수하게 ⟪k:1⟫싹튼 충동에 따라, ⟪k:2⟫그 장미를 꺾었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DC81D8E7_D1D5_403A_9526_7464AF7139EE
