msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B7CB4395_74CB_4BED_BC91_77ED56383548"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When I finally processed her question, that was when I realized I probably should have "
"left it to grow in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫지젤의 말을 듣고서야 ⟪k:2⟫원래는 정원에서 소중히 길러야 한단 걸 ⟪k:3⟫깨달았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2C55C16D_BDD3_47F4_AF33_277CFCE3C0AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be2eaa2adc0664892a56c6d26d138ff8293bd723b70a3542a107d4c3645bf153
