msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2C55C16D_BDD3_47F4_AF33_277CFCE3C0AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From the base of its stem, where I had plucked it, a droplet succumbed to gravity and fell "
"to the earth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫꺾은 장미의 줄기에서 ⟪k:1⟫식물의 수분이 조금 흘렀다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_80FA7215_9BF0_44DA_B232_0BA50AC9DCEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4f8cd086bfad69c5a7459cf7dac88624bfcb220e30d808123a1adb842c526e4
