msgid "⟪k:0⟫With it came the delayed realization that I had ended the plant’s life,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫꽃의 생명을 앗아갔단 자각이 뒤늦게 찾아왔지만, ⟪k:1⟫그보다는……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E0FF652B_F8EC_4BB3_B929_F5DC99E913CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d6021f7020b91758c9874f9926505f54354c0fe9ebfde5f0cbd7af9ba171f06
