msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’re going to need a vase then.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Give me just a minute—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그럼…… 꽃병을 준비해야겠네요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫잠깐 기다려 주세요――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A6A0EDA_118F_4C78_ADBC_97EF22F60A63
