#: scenario5:scenario5_9C09915C_8BA7_4913_B3CF_C0F9B58C1459
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ab429a958d5afcfa95a89c76b0e5e71d559e8959dc1d09a7c530673a41fd6ab
