msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A look of bewilderment filled Giselle’s face, just inches from mine, which hammered in the "
"reality of what I had just done."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫놀란 지젤의 표정을 가까이에서 보니――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫내가 지금 ⟪k:3⟫뭘 하는 건지 확 자각이 들었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_62452749_14C3_48A5_AD82_FEF1A69E24B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8f842b03f8ddd5500f10d2446a601768920de68cb637100eee3dbb56eb47b5d
