msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The thought had just crossed my mind that perhaps her black hair might prove a good backdrop "
"for the rose—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but it was ⟪k:3⟫supposed⟪k:4⟫ to remain a simple fancy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지젤의 흑발에 ⟪k:1⟫혹시 잘 어울리진 않을까 하여――, ⟪k:2⟫그 사고만 ⟪k:3⟫멍하게 했을 텐데."

